@startuml seq-dashboard
title Diagramme de séquence -- Consulter le tableau de bord

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor       #2C5282
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C5282
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor    #2C5282
    ActorBackgroundColor      #FAFAFA
    ActorBorderColor          #2C5282
}

actor Admin
participant "Frontend\n(React)"        as FE
participant "API Gateway"               as GW
participant "ProjectController"         as PC
participant "AccessControlService"      as ACS
participant "ProjectService"            as PS
participant "ClientRepository"          as CR
participant "ProjectRepository"         as PR
database  "PostgreSQL"                  as DB

Admin -> FE : Accéder à\n"Tableau de bord"
FE    -> GW : GET /api/projects/dashboard/stats\n(JWT)
GW    -> GW : Valider JWT
GW    -> PC : Forward + X-User-Role
PC    -> ACS : requireAnyRole("ADMIN")
ACS  --> PC : OK
PC    -> PS : getDashboardStats()

PS    -> CR : count()
CR    -> DB : SELECT count(*)\nFROM items_client
DB   --> CR : totalClients

PS    -> PR : countByStatusIn(...)
PR    -> DB : SELECT count(*)\nWHERE status IN (...)
DB   --> PR : activeProjects

PS    -> PR : countByStatus(COMPLETED)
PR    -> DB : SELECT count(*)\nWHERE status='COMPLETED'
DB   --> PR : completedProjects

PS    -> PR : countByCreatedAtAfter(firstDayMonth)
PR    -> DB : SELECT count(*)\nWHERE created_at >= ?
DB   --> PR : thisMonth

PS    -> PS : Construire DashboardStatsResponse\n(totalClients, activeProjects,\n completedProjects, thisMonth)
PS   --> PC : DashboardStatsResponse
PC   --> GW : 200 OK + JSON
GW   --> FE : 200 + statistiques
FE   --> Admin : Afficher cartes KPI\n+ graphiques

@enduml
